  "slug": "tallyprime-android-web-workflow",
  "title": "Using TallyPrime Data on Android and the Web",
  "description": "Understand which tasks happen on the TallyPrime PC and which records you can review on a phone or browser.",
  "category": "Setup",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "Give each device a job",
      "body": "TallyPrime runs on the accounting side. The Syncora Windows connector sends data from the selected company. On Android or in a browser, sign in to Syncora and open the company to review the synced records."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Choose the screen for the task",
      "body": "Use your phone to check a voucher number before a customer call. Use the browser when you want more room to compare dates, entries and a PDF. When someone corrects an entry in TallyPrime, check the next successful sync before relying on the changed amount outside the office."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Use the same reference on every device",
      "body": "If a voucher looks different across devices, write down the company, date range, type and number. Compare those before investigating the amounts. This catches the common mistake of opening two similarly named companies or two different periods."
    }
  ],
  "relatedPaths": [
    "/guides/tallyprime-setup",
    "/product-overview"
  ]
}
